{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XBPfg8vcXdbqysbtC7vBLT","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 irt_personfit_contam 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (37 个)\\n\\n- **exp-domain-analysis**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-ml-classifier-baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-clean-control-delta**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-fdr-correction**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-cross-benchmark-analysis**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-accuracy-zscore-baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-item-alignment-check**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-power-theory**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-empirical-null**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-leaderboard-data-recon**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-extended-sim**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-two-sided**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **phase_b_personfit**: DONE (success) — \\n- **sim_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral | Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 as a third model family (distinct tokenizer and training recipe from Qwen/Llama) produces significant Δlz* under controlled contamination, further confirming cross-family detection generalizability — addressing reviewer concern R4 about limited model diversity (2 families × 1 benchmark) | — | — | — |\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral-contam50 | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral-contam15 | — | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-contam-50（准备中）\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-contam-15（准备中）\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s2（准备中）\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s1（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-baseline-comparison** (success): IRT-based lz* detection outperforms binary-only baselines (accuracy z-score, LR, RF classifiers) on controlled contamination data, especially at low contamination rates (15%), because lz* leverages item-level difficulty calibration unavailable to methods operating on aggregate or uncalibrated binary vectors\\n  [baseline_comparison_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/exp-baseline-comparison/data/comparison_results.json)\\n- **exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean** (success): A Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct model fine-tuned on clean Alpaca data (no MMLU contamination) will show normal person-fit statistics (lz* within expected range), serving as the uncontaminated baseline for comparison with contaminated conditions.\\n- **exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean-s3** (success): Third independent clean Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct baseline (seed=456) for Cohen's d variance estimation: matches Qwen n=3 protocol for cross-family effect size comparison ← 基于 exp-ctrl-contam-llama\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 20 / 负向 6 / 失败 0 / 共 26\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-35694: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LFq5WFGnw5Lxn63YRAYRuE","session_id":"46a229a4-0dcc-4513-b62d-d6edf34e81e4","uuid":"849e8c1e-013c-4e7d-a2c9-7721f8d9fabe","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:51:15.168Z"}
