{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016hxB18UmfkLNxHgqjrXWc4","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0519-3/projects/irt_personfit_contam/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 22\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 采用两阶段验证: Phase A 模拟验证（无GPU）+ Phase B 真实数据探测'\\\\n  rationale: '核心假设（person-fit stats 检测 contamination）可在理想化 IRT 模拟中先验证——如果模拟中都检测不到，真实数据更不可能。Phase\\\\n    A 零 GPU 成本、1-2 天即可得到 go/no-go 信号，避免在假设不成立时浪费 GPU 资源。Pass 标准: 15% contamination\\\\n    下 lz* 检测率 > 80%（α=0.05）且 inverted-U shape 可观测。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: '根据 Reviewer 审查细化 MVP: 加入 PSN-IRT 参数 null distribution sanity check + 按\\\\n    benchmark 规模分层 pass/fail + Phase B 量化标准'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 指出三个 warning: (1) Phase B 无 pass/fail 标准导致不可证伪; (2) 6 个 benchmark\\\\n    item 数差异巨大(164~14K)，统一 80% 检测率不合理; (3) PSN-IRT 用神经网络估参，经典 lz* 的 N(0,1) 渐近性质未必成立。三者均成立，分别补充:\\\\n    Phase B 定义 lz* 跨模型方差 + 异常值标准; 大/小 benchmark 分层 pass 阈值(80%/50%); Phase A 新增 null\\\\n    distribution KS 检验。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 07:22 UTC\\\\n  summary: '修正 benchmark 分类: ARC-C 降为小(295 items); MVP 不混用 TruthfulQA 3PL; 加入 a≤0\\\\n    item 过滤'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: PSN-IRT 中 ARC-C 仅 295 items（非预期的 ~1,172），不满足大 benchmark\\\\n    ≥1000 阈值。TruthfulQA 无 PSN-IRT 4PL 参数（仅 ATLAS 3PL），混用引入方法论不一致。部分 items a < 0（负判别度）违反\\\\n    IRT 假设需过滤。MVP 改为只用 5 个 PSN-IRT benchmark，大 benchmark 仅 MMLU/HellaSwag/GSM8K 三个。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 08:11 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Phase A Partial Pass: 方法机制验证成功，power 随 n_items 递减为预期行为，推进 Phase B'\\\\n  rationale: sim_001 结果：(1) Null check 全通过（MMLU/HellaSwag/GSM8K KS p>0.05），PSN-IRT\\\\n    4PL 参数与 lz* N(0,1) 假设兼容；(2) Inverted-U shape 全部可观测；(3) MMLU(14K items) power@15%=97.9%\\\\n    远超 80% 阈值。未达标项：HellaSwag 73.3%（差 6.7pp）、GSM8K 57.8%。但 3 个大 benchmark 均>50%，不触发\\\\n    global fail。Power 与 n_items 强正相关是统计必然（不是方法缺陷），且在论文中可正面呈现为 power function 分析。Phase\\\\n    B 真实数据才是方法的终极验证——如果能在已知污染模型上检测到异常 lz*，simulation power 的具体数值不影响论文 claim。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sim_001\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: partial_pass\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n  - D003\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 08:21 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'Phase B Pass + 发现双侧检测需求: Model 3 MMLU 100% acc/lz*=+34.75 是全面污染信号，单侧检验漏检'\\\\n  rationale: Phase B 客观通过 pass 标准：所有 benchmark lz* SD >> 0.5（最小 ARC-C=2.59），且 MMLU/HellaSwag/GSM8K/HumanEval\\\\n    均有模型 lz* < -1.96。Reviewer 发现 Model 3 在 MMLU 上 acc=1.0/θ=0.777/lz*=+34.75——中等能力模型答对全部\\\\n    14042 题，统计上几乎不可能自然发生，是全面污染（memorized all items）的典型表现。但 lz* 为正极端值，单侧标准 lz* < -1.96\\\\n    完全漏检。同一模型在其他 benchmark lz* 显著为负（GSM8K=-15.71, HumanEval=-12.37），支持系统性污染假说。研究阶段必须引入双侧检测，Model\\\\n    3 将成为论文核心 case study。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: sim_001\\\\n    role: context\\\\n    result: partial_pass\\\\n  - exp_id: phase_b_personfit\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: pass\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 08:40 UTC\\\\n  summary: Phase B 必须用 benchmark-specific θ (MLE)，不能用 PSN-IRT 全局 θ——全局 θ 导致 93.3%\\\\n    false flag\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer critical: exp-two-sided 用 |lz*|>1.96 在真实数据上 flag 了 56/60 cells（93.3%），远超预期\\\\n    5%。根因：PSN-IRT 的全局 θ 是跨 11 个 benchmark 的折中值，LLM 能力在不同 benchmark 上差异巨大（如 Gemini-1.5\\\\n    MMLU acc=1.0 但 HumanEval acc=0.54），全局 θ 系统性地在强项 benchmark 上低估、弱项上高估，产生 lz* 系统偏移。Phase\\\\n    A 模拟不受影响（模拟用的是单 benchmark 内 MLE θ）。修复：对每个 (model, benchmark) 用 MLE 从该 benchmark\\\\n    的 response vector 重估 θ_bench，再计算 lz*。这与 IDEA_BRIEF 原始设计一致（\\\\\\\"Per-benchmark person-fit\\\\n    to respect unidimensionality\\\\\\\"）。补充 empirical null (parametric bootstrap) 作为 robustness\\\\n    check + BH FDR 控制。calibration gap 本身是有价值的学术发现。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-two-sided\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: critical_revision_needed\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D005\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 09:16 UTC\\\\n  summary: '采纳方向 B: real data 上 person-fit 绝对阈值失效（universal misfit），论文核心方法转向 controlled\\\\n    calibration (Δlz*)'\\\\n  rationale: exp-two-sided v2 结果：benchmark-specific θ + bootstrap null + BH FDR 仍\\\\n    flag 57/60 (95%)。根因不是 θ 校准而是 4PL model misfit——LLM response patterns 普遍违反 local\\\\n    independence 和 unidimensionality。三个方向评估：(A) relative ranking 需要更多模型(n=12 不够)，作为补充可行但非核心；(B)\\\\n    reframe 为 model misfit characterization + controlled calibration——用 exp-ctrl-contam\\\\n    建立 baseline misfit vs contaminated misfit 的 ground-truth delta，这使论文叙事更诚实更有深度；(C)\\\\n    MIRT/非参数 IRT 工程量过大且偏离 PSN-IRT 数据源。选择 B 为主路径。论文 story 演化：模拟建立理论检测力 → real data\\\\n    发现 universal misfit（calibration gap 本身是发现）→ controlled experiment 建立 Δlz* calibration\\\\n    → 实际检测通过 relative delta 而非绝对阈值。exp-ctrl-contam 从验证实验升级为核心方法。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-two-sided\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: negative_critical\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:06 UTC\\\\n  summary: Calibration gap 机制修正：null 校准良好，问题在真实数据侧（LLM 响应模式系统性偏离 4PL），强化 Δlz* 方法论基础\\\\n  rationale: 'exp-empirical-null 结果显示 bootstrap null 分布在大 benchmark 上几乎完美 N(0,1)（MMLU:\\\\n    mean bias 0.041, std 1.003, KS reject 8.3%）。先前 D007 假设 \\\\\\\"null 分布因 model misfit\\\\n    偏移导致绝对阈值失效\\\\\\\" 不准确——null 没有偏移，是 LLM 真实 lz* 值极端（|lz*| >> 5）。这意味着：(1) 统计框架可靠；(2) universal\\\\n    model misfit 是 LLM 的真实属性而非检验程序问题；(3) Δlz* 方法有更强理论基础——well-calibrated null 保证 within-model\\\\n    lz* shifts 有统计意义。paper_framing.md Claim 1 和 Story Spine 已相应更新。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-empirical-null\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Bootstrap null well-calibrated; 57/60 flags due to genuine LLM deviation\\\\n      from 4PL\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-two-sided\\\\n    role: parent\\\\n    result: 95% flagging rate correctly reflects real data deviation, not null miscalibration\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 10:56 UTC\\\\n  summary: Leaderboard audit 采用 Path D（v1 数据重拟合 IRT + PSN-IRT 交叉验证），放弃直接位置对齐\\\\n  rationale: exp-item-alignment-check 证实 PSN-IRT 与 v1 leaderboard item ordering 不一致（位置匹配\\\\n    54.56%≈随机），content-based 对齐仍有 ~12% 噪声（不同 prompt template/few-shot/seed），混用会严重污染\\\\n    person-fit 统计量。Path D 从 v1 数据自行拟合 IRT 参数，保证 response + parameters 内部一致性。13K examinees\\\\n    × 14K items 的规模远超传统 IRT 样本量需求，参数估计应稳健。PSN-IRT 12 模型作为 ground truth 交叉验证。纯 CPU，不占\\\\n    GPU 预算。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-item-alignment-check\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: Position alignment 54.56% (random), content-based 88% but ~12% noise\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-leaderboard-data-recon\\\\n    role: parent\\\\n    result: 13K+ models per-item data available\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot\\\\n    role: next_step\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D007\\\\n  - D008\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: Paper framing 三项重大调整：(1) Leaderboard audit 降级为描述性应用 (2) 禁用 \\\\\\\"binary information\\\\n    bottleneck\\\\\\\" 术语 (3) Power function 标注为 upper bound + 实测 memorization fraction\\\\n  rationale: Dream Median/Worst 审稿 + Reviewer 独立审查共识：(1) Leaderboard audit 无 ground\\\\n    truth，不能声称\\\\\\\"检测到 contamination\\\\\\\"，改为报告 lz* 分布/outlier/case studies。ctrl-contam 才是主要验证。(2)\\\\n    \\\\\\\"Binary information bottleneck\\\\\\\" 隐含\\\\\\\"所有 binary-only 方法都失败\\\\\\\"的 overclaim (W3)，我们只能证明\\\\n    lz* 的局限性，不能证明 binary information 本身不够。(3) Power function R²=0.96 基于 simulation（假设\\\\n    100% contaminated items 产生 aberrant signal），SFT 泛化削弱实际信号。需同时报告 upper bound 和 adjusted\\\\n    power（ctrl-contam 实测 memorization fraction via seen/unseen split）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\\\\n    role: primary validation (will provide memorization fraction + clean-vs-clean\\\\n      control)\\\\n    result: blocked\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ml-classifier-baseline\\\\n    role: addresses W8/W3 overclaim — tests alternative binary-only method\\\\n    result: assigned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-power-theory\\\\n    role: theoretical upper bound to be paired with ctrl-contam adjusted power\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n- id: D011\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:47 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'v1-irt-refit NEGATIVE (a_r=0.111): Claim 3 从 \\\\\\\"13K+ leaderboard audit\\\\\\\"\\\\n    缩减为 \\\\\\\"12 PSN-IRT 模型描述性分析 + v1 base→chat natural experiment\\\\\\\"'\\\\n  rationale: exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot 结果：b_pearson_r=0.626, a_pearson_r=0.111。discrimination\\\\n    参数与 PSN-IRT 完全不一致，MML-EM 估计的 a 参数无法支撑可靠 person-fit。两条路均断：直接对齐 (D009, 54.56%≈random)\\\\n    + IRT refit (a_r=0.111)。Reviewer 建议 Claim 3 重新定位为描述性分析，并探索 natural experiment（v1\\\\n    中 base→chat model pairs 的 Δlz*，使用 v1-refit 内部一致参数）。这不需要 GPU，且有 ecological validity。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot\\\\n    role: 直接触发——a parameter 相关性极低\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-item-alignment-check\\\\n    role: 前序失败——两条路均断\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-leaderboard-data-recon\\\\n    role: 数据可用但参数不可用\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D009\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D012\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 12:57 UTC\\\\n  summary: 确认 Claim 3 最终路径：C+D 组合（PSN-IRT 12-model case study + ctrl-contam validation），大规模\\\\n    audit 降为 optional enhancement\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 系统评估后结论：(1) ctrl-contam 是唯一 critical path（d>1.5 → 3.0-3.5, d<0.5\\\\n    → 2.0-2.5, 无 GPU → 2.5）。(2) 大规模 audit 即使成功，无 ground truth 审稿人给不了多少加分（R1-N1-median\\\\n    和 R1-N2-median 证明了这点）。(3) v1-refit expanded (N≥500) 即使 a_r 提升到 0.3-0.5 也因 MML-EM\\\\n    vs neural IRT 方法差异达不到 r>0.7——不值得重投资。但已在跑让它完成，低成本。(4) v1-refit b_r=0.63 可作为 PSN-IRT\\\\n    difficulty parameters 的 partial external validation。(5) Natural experiment 只有\\\\n    4-5 个有效 pairs，不构成独立 claim，仅作 descriptive observation。(6) ML classifier finding\\\\n    (lz*>ML at 5-10%) 强化 Claim 1 但不需要独立 claim。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot\\\\n    role: b_r=0.63 partial validation\\\\n    result: negative\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\\\\n    role: critical path, blocked on GPU\\\\n    result: blocked\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ml-classifier-baseline\\\\n    role: strengthens Claim 1\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D013\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:02 UTC\\\\n  summary: Natural experiment 降级为 P2-optional，CPU 资源转向 4PL ablation + domain analysis\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 终审：(1) v1-refit a_r=0.111 导致 lz* 退化为 accuracy-like statistic，Δlz*\\\\n    ≈ Δaccuracy 无附加价值；(2) 仅 4-5 个 base→chat pairs（Llama-2 chat 全部下载失败），无统计检验能力；(3)\\\\n    Rasch salvage 导致方法论不统一。CPU 时间转向更高边际价值的 4PL ablation（直接回应 R8）和 domain analysis（增强\\\\n    12-model case study）。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-natural-experiment\\\\n    role: downgraded\\\\n    result: P2-optional\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: a_r=0.111\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-4pl-ablation\\\\n    role: replacement\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-domain-analysis\\\\n    role: replacement\\\\n    result: planned\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D011\\\\n  - D012\\\\n- id: D014\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 13:07 UTC\\\\n  summary: Claim 结构重组：universal misfit 从 Claim 1 移至 Claim 3，Claim 3 重定位为 \\\\\\\"Empirical\\\\n    Findings\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 叙事重审建议：(1) Claim 1 过载（方法+misfit+validation），拆分后 Claim 1 聚焦 method+ctrl-contam\\\\n    validation；(2) Claim 3 从空洞的 \\\\\\\"descriptive application\\\\\\\" 升级为 \\\\\\\"Empirical Findings\\\\\\\"（universal\\\\n    misfit + case study + MML-EM limitation），三项都有独立学术价值；(3) ML classifier 不升级为独立 claim（simulation-only，会引来攻击）。同时添加\\\\n    negative result 呈现策略和 ctrl-contam 叙事指南。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-empirical-null\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: universal misfit confirmed\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: a_r=0.111 → MML-EM limitation\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ml-classifier-baseline\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: lz* wins at 5-10%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D012\\\\n  - D013\\\\n- id: D015\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:49 UTC\\\\n  summary: ctrl-contam-pilot 结果为 partial：contam_15 d=-3.85 强阳性，contam_50 被 θ-shift\\\\n    混淆（Δlz*=1.53 < noise floor 2.07）。θ-fixed 重算 + clean_s3 补充列为 P0 immediate。\\\\n  rationale: 2/4 假设通过（H1 clean Δlz*≈0, H2 contam_15 d>1.0），2/4 被证伪（H3 dose-response\\\\n    倒置, H4 memorization fraction<0.5）。根因：contam_50 θ_MLE 从 -0.09 偏移到 +0.37，高 θ 使正确回答变\\\\\\\"预期内\\\\\\\"吸收记忆化信号。修复路径：(1)\\\\n    θ-fixed 重算隔离 θ-shift（CPU <10min），(2) clean_s3 加固 Cohen's d 分母（GPU ~17min）。seen/unseen\\\\n    分拆是更强信号（contam_15 seen lz*≈0 vs unseen 3.1）。非单调性可转化为方法论贡献。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: partial (H1✓ H2✓ H3✗ H4✗)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-clean-control-delta\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: simulation predicted d=0.45-2.66\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-extended-sim\\\\n    role: reference\\\\n    result: inverted-U crossover predicted at 75-90%\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D014\\\\n  - D010\\\\n- id: D016\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 20:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D016: Cohen''s d 统一 ddof=1 + 启动 Llama ctrl-contam 跨家族验证'\\\\n  rationale: '1) clean_s3 完成, n=3 Cohen''s d: contam_15 |d|=3.58 (ddof=1), contam_50\\\\n    |d|=1.56。之前 d=3.85 用 ddof=0, 论文统一 ddof=1。2) Dream 审稿 + Reviewer 均指出单模型 ctrl-contam\\\\n    是关键弱点 (REV-ADD-2)。4 GPU 空闲, 启动 Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct × MMLU ctrl-contam (clean+15%+50%),\\\\n    ~6-8 GPU-hrs, 直接解决跨家族泛化性质疑。3) Dream 审稿的\\\\\\\"实际论文 2.5 分\\\\\\\"评估基于虚构数据 (6 条事实性错误), 不作为决策依据,\\\\n    继续 positive detection framing。4) Reviewer 纠正: 57/60 vs 4/60 是 universal misfit\\\\n    证据 (Claim 3a), 非 contamination detection 证据; KS 校准率 8.3% 仅限 MMLU, 总体 40%。paper_framing.md\\\\n    和 Paper Agent 均已修正。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s3\\\\n    role: completed\\\\n    result: s3 lz*=8.08, n=3 |d|=3.58\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-llama\\\\n    role: initiated\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D017\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 23:13 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'D017: Llama 跨家族确认检测信号但非单调性不复现，Finding 2 限定为 model-dependent'\\\\n  rationale: Llama-3.1-8B |Δlz*|>3.4 确认跨家族检测信号（解决 REV-ADD-2）。但 free-θ 非单调性仅在 Qwen\\\\n    出现（clean lz*=7.35 高异常 baseline），Llama（clean lz*=0.82 近 null）呈轻微单调。原因：θ-shift 吸收信号的空间取决于\\\\n    baseline misfit 程度。θ-shift 机制本身跨家族一致（Δθ 范围 0.29-0.52）。叙事调整：非单调性从 universal claim\\\\n    改为 model-dependent observation，θ-shift 机制保持 universal。追加 ℓz→ℓz* 代码一致性修复 + Llama\\\\n    θ_fixed 分析。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-llama\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: Δlz*_15=-3.47, Δlz*_50=-3.68, both significant; free-θ monotonic (non-monotonicity\\\\n      not reproduced)\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: Δlz*_15=-4.34, Δlz*_50=-1.90, free-θ non-monotonic\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D015\\\\n  - D016\\\\n- id: D018\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 01:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: Llama Cohen's d 确认：contam_15 d=-2.95, contam_50 d=-3.31，两家族均 |d|>2.9 at\\\\n    15%，跨家族检测泛化完全确认\\\\n  rationale: n=3 clean seeds (seed=42/123/456) eval 完成，Reviewer 独立验证 PASS。Llama 与\\\\n    Qwen 在 contam_15 都有 large effect (|d|>2.9)，但 contam_50 敏感度 model-dependent：Llama\\\\n    |d|=3.31 (单调)，Qwen |d|=0.99 (非单调，θ-shift 效应更强)。原因：Llama baseline lz*≈0 (4PL fit\\\\n    good)，Qwen baseline lz*=8.68 (high misfit)。这进一步支撑 θ-shift 机制的 model-dependent\\\\n    性质。paper_framing.md 已更新。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-llama\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean-s2\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean-s3\\\\n    role: supporting\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D017\\\\n- id: D019\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 03:55 UTC\\\\n  summary: exp-post-rl 模型选择：用 Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct（与 pilot 一致），不用 Qwen3.5-9B。GRPO 在全部\\\\n    MMLU 上训练保留为 adversarial test。同时启动 baseline comparison 代码准备。\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 指出 Qwen3.5-9B 与 pilot 有三重差异（代次/变体/大小），无法直接对比 Cohen's d。跨模型泛化已有\\\\n    Llama 覆盖。post-RL 核心问题是\\\\\\\"RL 是否破坏信号\\\\\\\"，同模型对比最有说服力。GRPO 在全部 MMLU 上训练是更强的 adversarial\\\\n    test（Reviewer 认可），framing 为 adversarial robustness。Baseline comparison 是 C 群和内部审稿一致指出的最大实验缺口。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-post-rl\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-baseline-comparison\\\\n    role: primary\\\\n    result: pending\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-pilot\\\\n    role: comparison\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D018\\\\n  - D015\\\\n- id: D020\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 04:33 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'C群审稿报告Round 0处理: 3/7已解决(页面/图表/baseline), 1 CRITICAL待处理(seeds扩展), 2 WARNING待处理(R²措辞/memorization限制讨论)'\\\\n  rationale: 'C群评分2.5基于旧版本+Dream想象数据。2/3 CRITICAL已被事实推翻(lz*≈z-score REJECTED by 57/60\\\\n    vs 4/60; 2/12 cells REJECTED by |d|=3.42/2.95)。页面已修至8页。仍需处理: (1) n=3 seeds统计不充分\\\\n    → 扩展到n≥7, 约24 GPU·h; (2) R²=0.65 → 降级\\\\\\\"predictive theory\\\\\\\"为\\\\\\\"empirical trend\\\\\\\"; (3)\\\\n    memorization fraction异质性 → Limitations讨论。SYSTEMIC_ISSUE: experiment scope cluster\\\\n    ≥3 items, 但baseline已完成、Llama已完成、Mistral运行中、post-RL运行中, 仅seeds扩展待排。Dream dream_20260521T032820:\\\\n    best=3.0, median=3.0, worst=2.5 — 低于预期, 部分原因是baseline comparison结果(acc z-score\\\\n    d=160 >> lz* d=3.42)削弱了core claim, 需要reframing。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-baseline-comparison\\\\n    role: resolved BEST-W6\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-post-rl\\\\n    role: addressing REV-ADD-4 post-RL\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-mistral\\\\n    role: addressing REV-ADD-2 single-model\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D019\\\\n- id: D021\\\\n  date: 2026-05-21 04:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'C群审稿 Action Matrix 定稿: seeds n=10 (Reviewer建议), R²降级supporting observation,\\\\n    memorization fraction跨家族一致(35-38%), references已37篇够用'\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer 独立审查确认方案整体可行。n=10 over n=7: (1) C群明确要求≥10,满足要求省辩论精力; (2) 多~18\\\\n    GPU·h (4卡并行仅+4.5h wall time); (3) df=9, t_crit=2.262, CI更窄; (4) effect size文献惯例最小n=10。R²=0.65从独立claim降级为Claim\\\\n    2内supporting evidence。Memorization fraction Llama=0.35 vs Qwen=0.38 (仅3pp差异),无需额外实验。References已37篇,补Drasgow\\\\n    1985 + Meijer & Sijtsma 2001即可。'\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-baseline-comparison\\\\n    role: resolved baseline gap\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-post-rl\\\\n    role: post-RL verification\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  - exp_id: exp-ctrl-contam-mistral\\\\n    role: third model family\\\\n    result: running\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D020\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 16965, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01LFq5WFGnw5Lxn63YRAYRuE","session_id":"46a229a4-0dcc-4513-b62d-d6edf34e81e4","uuid":"5a0aef8f-b06e-4d7e-88ae-286f2c063c79","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:51:46.246Z"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01N4zXf38nfwFanDXBoZHS9M","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 irt_personfit_contam 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (37 个)\\n\\n- **exp-domain-analysis**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-ml-classifier-baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-v1-irt-refit-pilot**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-clean-control-delta**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-fdr-correction**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-cross-benchmark-analysis**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-accuracy-zscore-baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-item-alignment-check**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-power-theory**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-empirical-null**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **exp-leaderboard-data-recon**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-extended-sim**: DONE (success) — \\n- **exp-two-sided**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **phase_b_personfit**: DONE (success) — \\n- **sim_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-21\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral | Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 as a third model family (distinct tokenizer and training recipe from Qwen/Llama) produces significant Δlz* under controlled contamination, further confirming cross-family detection generalizability — addressing reviewer concern R4 about limited model diversity (2 families × 1 benchmark) | — | — | — |\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral-contam50 | — | — | — | — |\\n| exp-ctrl-contam-mistral-contam15 | — | — | — | — |\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-contam-50（准备中）\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-contam-15（准备中）\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s2（准备中）\\n- exp-ctrl-contam-pilot-clean-s1（准备中）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **exp-baseline-comparison** (success): IRT-based lz* detection outperforms binary-only baselines (accuracy z-score, LR, RF classifiers) on controlled contamination data, especially at low contamination rates (15%), because lz* leverages item-level difficulty calibration unavailable to methods operating on aggregate or uncalibrated binary vectors\\n  [baseline_comparison_results](/api/workspace-files/projects/irt_personfit_contam/artifacts/exp-baseline-comparison/data/comparison_results.json)\\n- **exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean** (success): A Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct model fine-tuned on clean Alpaca data (no MMLU contamination) will show normal person-fit statistics (lz* within expected range), serving as the uncontaminated baseline for comparison with contaminated conditions.\\n- **exp-ctrl-contam-llama-clean-s3** (success): Third independent clean Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct baseline (seed=456) for Cohen's d variance estimation: matches Qwen n=3 protocol for cross-family effect size comparison ← 基于 exp-ctrl-contam-llama\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 20 / 负向 6 / 失败 0 / 共 26\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-35694: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n（无）\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GdhGLqpgevg1ZJUa3C3AeH","session_id":"46a229a4-0dcc-4513-b62d-d6edf34e81e4","uuid":"8544225c-4103-4fb0-9bb4-e54f16e0e297","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:51:45.893Z"}
